- sip_device
- mcu
- phone

Note: Currently, only the phone type is supported.

This parameter is required.', example='phone'),
  registered?: boolean(name='Registered', description='Specifies whether the third-party meeting system requires registration for inbound calls.

This parameter is required.', example='false'),
  serverAddress?: string(name='ServerAddress', description='1. The IP address of the nearest RTC SIP server.
