  sipDisplayName?: string(name='SipDisplayName', description='The username displayed on the third-party system.

This parameter is required.', example='testdevice'),
  sipRoomId?: string(name='SipRoomId', description='1. When the device is mcu, it indicates the channel number of the third-party meeting system to be called.
2. When the device is sip_device, it indicates the registration number of the registered device to be invited.
3. When the device is phone, it indicates the called phone number.

This parameter is required.', example='18512514528'),
  sipUri?: string(name='SipUri', description='1. When the device is mcu, it indicates the address information of the third-party meeting system in the format of ip:port;transport=tcp/udp/tls.
