Example: 39.101.232.13
3. When the device is phone, it indicates the address information of the telephone gateway.
Example: "30.240.160.66:5060;transport=tcp"', example='30.240.160.66:5060;transport=tcp'),
  sipUserAgent?: string(name='SipUserAgent', description='The brand and model of the third-party SIP endpoint being called, such as polycom, cisco, tencent, zoom, or pstn.', example='pstn'),
